<div class="hero-section py-5 service-page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center min-vh-50">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto text-center">
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3" data-page-h1>
          Job photos turned into google posts for an HVAC company
        </h1>
        <p class="mb-0" style="max-width: 980px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95)">
          A headless marketing pipeline that converts MMS photos into optimized Google Business and Meta posts, using Vision AI to generate accurate, localized captions with management approvals.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="inner-sections">

  <section class="py-5 bg-white" id="problem">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-4 align-items-start">
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-7">
          <h2 class="heading-border heading-center heading-left mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">The problem</h2>
          <p class="large-para mb-3">
            Local service businesses (HVAC, plumbing, roofing) live or die by local search ranking. Technicians complete high quality work daily, but rarely have time or incentive to document
            it consistently, so social proof goes stale and map pack visibility suffers.
          </p>
          <p class="large-para mb-0">
            The client needed a &ldquo;zero UI&rdquo; workflow for non technical field staff: no app installs, no caption writing, and no complex steps. The system also had to generate SEO relevant content
            without feeling spammy, while giving management final control via an approval/kill switch workflow.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5">
          <%= render "home/case_studies/at_a_glance",
            industry: "HVAC / home services",
            client: "Red Dragon HVAC",
            country: "United States",
            what_we_built: "MMS-to-social headless pipeline with Vision AI captions and approval-gated publishing",
            integrations: "Twilio (MMS), Google Business Profile API, Meta Graph API (Facebook/Instagram)",
            stack: "FastAPI, LangChain, OpenAI Vision API (GPT-4o)" %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-light-grey" id="what-we-built">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">What we built</h2>
        <p class="large-para mb-3">
          We built a headless marketing pipeline that converts standard MMS (texted photos) into optimized Google Business and Facebook posts. Vision AI identifies what&rsquo;s in the image so
          technicians don&rsquo;t write a single word of copy.
        </p>
        <p class="large-para mb-0">
          The pipeline is event driven and approval gated: images are ingested, metadata is stripped, GPS context is applied for localization, and management approves before publishing.
          This yields daily, photo verified proof without adding staff overhead.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-white" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">How it works</h2>
        <ul class="service-page-list mb-4">
          <li><strong>Asynchronous image processing:</strong> Event driven ingestion strips metadata and enriches with GPS coordinates for localized tagging.</li>
          <li><strong>Automated SEO copywriting:</strong> NLP generates human sounding captions that include location and money keywords naturally.</li>
          <li><strong>Architecture:</strong> FastAPI &rarr; LangChain &rarr; OpenAI Vision API (GPT 4o).</li>
          <li><strong>Integrations:</strong> Twilio (MMS), Google Business Profile API, Meta Graph API (Facebook/Instagram).</li>
          <li><strong>Security:</strong> Secure S3 buckets with limited access IAM roles; human in the loop &ldquo;kill switch&rdquo; dashboard for review.</li>
          <li><strong>AI features:</strong> Visual object recognition identifies equipment (e.g., &ldquo;Carrier Infinity Furnace&rdquo;) to keep captions technically accurate.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-light-grey" id="results">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">Results</h2>
        <ul class="service-page-list mb-0">
          <li><strong>Local lead growth</strong> via improved map pack rankings and consistent, location relevant content.</li>
          <li><strong>High adoption</strong> because the workflow requires only a text message, no apps, no logins, no caption writing.</li>
          <li><strong>Better engagement</strong> due to fresh, photo verified social proof and approval gated publishing.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%= render "home/case_studies/gallery", slug: "red-dragon-hvac" %>
  <%= render "home/case_studies/client_quote", slug: "red-dragon-hvac" %>
  <%= render "home/case_studies/cta", blurb: "We&rsquo;ll design your pipeline with approvals, observability, and predictable publishing, without adding operational burden." %>

  <section class="py-4 bg-white">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <%= link_to "Operations-heavy software →", industry_professional_services_path, class: "service-card-link ajax" %>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>